/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, and July to August in 26. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 31% of normal in November to December and 50% in January to February. Grid 10989 had its driest year in 1956 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
